<p>Touch a target (or yourself) to infuse it with Nature, healing it for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">333, 442, 526, 597, 661</acronym> (this heal does not work on undead).</p><p>The amount healed will increase with your Mindpower.</p>